{"game": "gunfire-reborn", "language": "english", "appid": 1217060, "month": "2026-03", "window": 4, "start_date": 1774310400, "end_date": 1775001599, "month_true_total": 126, "quota": 5, "returned": 5, "pulled_at": "2026-09-27 01:56:09 UTC", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "222147947", "author": {"steamid": "76561198014985091", "personaname": "YolBolsun", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198014985091/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 19, "playtime_forever": 465, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 377, "last_played": 1776229335, "avatar": "b6a611b2ca683b31381cfe7d47cf4eef27c752fc"}, "language": "english", "review": "Very fun game for steamdeck to play before bed", "timestamp_created": 1774925029, "timestamp_updated": 1774925029, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1637202540", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "222140873", "author": {"steamid": "76561198770143974", "personaname": "Auggert", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/Auggert/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 19, "playtime_forever": 3694, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 2649, "last_played": 1786084153, "avatar": "aec6e93f95be8d341d04cc812d42955b9a2b87b8"}, "language": "english", "review": "A super fun roguelite with really clean gunplay. There’s a good variety of characters, and the RNG abilities and scrolls make it easy to try new things every run. Progression feels a bit overwhelming at first, but once it clicks, it gets really satisfying and way more fun to push higher difficulties. The DLC packs add a lot of extra variety, but the base game already has plenty. Definitely worth it, especially with friends.", "timestamp_created": 1774915533, "timestamp_updated": 1774915533, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1637202540", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "222138143", "author": {"steamid": "76561198360837884", "personaname": "FattoCattoGaming", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/FattoCattoGaming/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 62, "playtime_forever": 5967, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 5621, "last_played": 1784424440, "avatar": "0f3fd88fe443698098063522a05756bde3067471"}, "language": "english", "review": "An extremely fun roguelike, with or without friends, that has a great gameplay loop that can be both fun and relaxing or a challenging experience. It has wide variety of playable gooby woobies with unique designs and abilities (that only get a little more broken as they release) as well as all kinds of weapons, items, and upgrades that make each run feel unique.", "timestamp_created": 1774912139, "timestamp_updated": 1774912139, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1637202540", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "222137988", "author": {"steamid": "76561199028511800", "personaname": "Random Adventurer", "persona_status": "in-game", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199028511800/", "num_games_owned": 99, "num_reviews": 1, "playtime_forever": 22589, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 20445, "last_played": 1787448349, "avatar": "9955e43132ddbc360c6c4260aa320b4385b96ab8"}, "language": "english", "review": "A great FPS Rogue-like with tons of build variety. The opportunity to get crazy overpowered is there while keeping the game difficult enough at the higher difficulties. Great for casual play on lower difficulties and great for getting competitive at higher ones. You can tell the devs care because it gets updated relatively frequently and updates can contain quite a bit of stuff. Best thing to come out of China since my iPhone", "timestamp_created": 1774911959, "timestamp_updated": 1775118007, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1637202540", "hardware": {"system_ram": "7911", "os": "Artix Linux", "cpu_name": "        Intel(R) Core(TM) i7-3770 CPU @ 3.40GHz", "adapter_description": "Mesa llvmpipe (LLVM 22.1.1, 256 bits)", "vram_size": 2944}, "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "222106010", "author": {"steamid": "76561198080498617", "personaname": "NUEXGUY", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/ryanpond/", "num_games_owned": 255, "num_reviews": 14, "playtime_forever": 4637, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 2121, "last_played": 1781492834, "avatar": "c55c773c6066955cf32745d8ed29145bc17a7b59"}, "language": "english", "review": "BORDERLANDS with the gameplay that we wanted.\r\nOVERWATCH with the PVE mode for which everyone waited.\r\nHADES and RISK OF RAIN 2 in first person.\r\n\r\nI've poured 35 hours into this game and love every moment with it. There are a ton of characters, and each one plays very unique from the rest. There are no repeats here, the levels are fun and varied enough to create a challenge in each run, and the weapons range from powerful to quirky with enough bullets to punch through just about any challenge.\r\n\r\nIf you love endless run rogue-likes, and fast paced first person action, with a lot of variety in characters, skills, weapons, and environments then this is a must play!", "timestamp_created": 1774882117, "timestamp_updated": 1774882117, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 12, "votes_funny": 2, "weighted_vote_score": "0.57767486572265625", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1637202540", "hardware": {"system_ram": "32060", "os": "Windows 11", "cpu_name": "AMD Ryzen 5 7640U w/ Radeon 760M Graphics      ", "adapter_description": "AMD Radeon(TM) 760M", "vram_size": 418}, "reactions": [{"reaction_type": 26, "count": 1}]}]}